WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.065
Hi! I'm Leo the lion. Let's count to three!

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.961
One two three roar

3
00:00:08.061 --> 00:00:11.022
Clap clap one two

4
00:00:11.122 --> 00:00:14.084
Three stars shine bright

5
00:00:14.184 --> 00:00:17.145
Little lion count again

6
00:00:18.545 --> 00:00:21.160
Can you count with me? One, two, three!

7
00:00:24.045 --> 00:00:27.006
One two three roar

8
00:00:27.106 --> 00:00:30.067
Clap clap one two

9
00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:33.129
Three stars shine bright

10
00:00:33.229 --> 00:00:36.190
Little lion count again

11
00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:40.697
Amazing counting! Give yourself a little clap.
